This software and accompanying documentation (the "Simulator") are provided
for the purpose of demonstrating the economic feasibility of GIGAette's
IsoTES (Isobaric Thermal Energy Storage) system in district heating
applications in Mongolia, including but not limited to investor relations,
KOICA reporting, and Official Development Assistance (ODA) presentations.

PERMITTED USE
-------------
- Viewing and interacting with the Simulator via the official live demo URL
- Downloading the Simulator HTML for personal evaluation purposes
- Citing simulation results in third-party reports with attribution to
  GIGAette Co., Ltd.
- Forking the repository for non-commercial educational purposes

PROHIBITED USE
--------------
- Commercial redistribution, sublicensing, or sale of the Simulator
- Removal or alteration of attribution, copyright notices, or branding
- Use of the Simulator's calculations or default parameter values to make
  competing or derivative business viability claims without independent
  verification and explicit acknowledgment of the source
- Misrepresentation of simulation outputs as official GIGAette financial
  guidance or investment advice

